<translate>
==== MountOn ==== <!--T:1-->

<!--T:2-->
Indicates which weapon this item (Weapon part) can be applied to.
<syntaxhighlight lang="Java">
MountOn = HuntingRifle; VarmintRifle; Shotgun,
</syntaxhighlight>
